---
permalink: /newsletter/index.html
---

{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block head %}
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Briefing — A Weekly AI &amp; Business Newsletter for Operators | Sora Labs</title>
<meta name="description" content="The Briefing is a free weekly newsletter from Sora Labs: the AI, tools, and market shifts that actually matter for people running a business. Subscribe or browse past issues.">
<meta property="og:title" content="The Briefing — Weekly AI &amp; Business Newsletter | Sora Labs">
<meta property="og:description" content="A free weekly read for operators: what changed in AI and business, and what to do about it. Written for people running one, not watching from the outside.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://sora-labs.net/newsletter/">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=Libre+Franklin:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 80px; }
body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: var(--body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-x: hidden; }
body::after { content: ''; position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 9999; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.03; background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E"); }
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
.container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

/* NAV */
nav { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100; padding: 16px 0; background: rgba(10,10,12,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
nav .container { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; max-width: 1200px; }
.nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 500; }
.nav-mark { width: 30px; height: 30px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 7px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--bg); }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: center; }
.nav-links a { font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-dim); transition: color 0.2s; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text-secondary); }
.nav-links a.active { color: var(--accent); }
.nav-cta { color: var(--bg) !important; background: var(--accent); padding: 7px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600 !important; transition: background 0.2s; }
.nav-cta:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }

/* HERO */
.hero { padding: 150px 0 40px; text-align: center; position: relative; }
.hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -100px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 800px; height: 480px; background: radial-gradient(ellipse, var(--accent-glow) 0%, transparent 65%); pointer-events: none; }
.hero-label { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-dim); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.hero h1 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.6rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.03em; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 18px; }
.hero h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
.hero-sub { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.7; }

/* SIGNUP CARD */
.signup { padding: 24px 0 20px; }
.signup-card { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 40px 40px; text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.signup-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -60px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 500px; height: 300px; background: radial-gradient(ellipse, var(--accent-glow) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none; }
.signup-card > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.signup-card h2 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.signup-card p.lead { font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 24px; }
.embeddable-buttondown-form { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
.embeddable-buttondown-form label { display: none; }
.embeddable-buttondown-form input[type="email"] { flex: 1; font-family: var(--body); font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 14px 18px; background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; color: var(--text); outline: none; transition: border-color 0.2s; }
.embeddable-buttondown-form input[type="email"]::placeholder { color: var(--text-dim); }
.embeddable-buttondown-form input[type="email"]:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
.embeddable-buttondown-form input[type="submit"] { font-family: var(--body); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 14px 24px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); border: none; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; white-space: nowrap; }
.embeddable-buttondown-form input[type="submit"]:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }
.embeddable-buttondown-form p { display: none; }
.signup-note { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: 14px; font-family: var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
.archive-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 0.04em; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
.archive-link:hover { opacity: 0.75; }
@media (max-width: 560px) { .embeddable-buttondown-form { flex-direction: column; } }

/* WHAT YOU GET */
.get { padding: 56px 0 64px; }
.get-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 36px; }
.get-head .section-label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.get-head h2 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.get-list { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
.get-item { display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
.get-item .n { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--accent); padding-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.get-item h3 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.get-item p { font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }

/* CLOSING */
.close { text-align: center; padding: 8px 0 88px; }
.close p { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }
.close a { color: var(--accent); }

/* FOOTER */
footer { padding: 40px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
.footer-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
.footer-left { font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--text-dim); }
.footer-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.footer-links a { font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--text-dim); transition: color 0.2s; }
.footer-links a:hover { color: var(--text-secondary); }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; }
  .signup-card { padding: 32px 24px; }
  .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; text-align: center; }
  .footer-links { justify-content: center; }
}
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block nav %}
{% set nav_active = "newsletter" %}
{% include "nav.njk" %}
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-label">The Briefing · Free &amp; Weekly</div>
    <h1>A weekly read for people <em>running the business</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">The AI, tools, and market shifts that actually matter for operators. No hype, no filler. Written for people running a business, not watching from the outside.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="signup">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="signup-card">
      <h2>Get The Briefing</h2>
      <p class="lead">Join for free. One issue a week, and you can unsubscribe anytime.</p>
      <form action="https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/nclawdev" method="post" class="embeddable-buttondown-form">
        <label for="bd-email">Enter your email</label>
        <input type="email" name="email" id="bd-email" placeholder="you@business.com" required>
        <input type="submit" value="Subscribe free">
        <p><a href="https://buttondown.com/refer/nclawdev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Powered by Buttondown.</a></p>
      </form>
      <div class="signup-note">Free. Weekly. Unsubscribe anytime.</div>
      <a href="https://buttondown.com/nclawdev/archive/" class="archive-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Browse past issues &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="get">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="get-head">
      <div class="section-label">What you get</div>
      <h2>Signal, not noise</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="get-list">
      <div class="get-item">
        <div class="n">01</div>
        <div>
          <h3>What changed this week</h3>
          <p>The AI and business shifts that actually affect operators, in plain language. We skip the hype cycle and tell you what is real.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="get-item">
        <div class="n">02</div>
        <div>
          <h3>One tool or tactic worth your time</h3>
          <p>Something you can actually use, vetted for people who run a business rather than watch the industry.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="get-item">
        <div class="n">03</div>
        <div>
          <h3>A move worth reacting to</h3>
          <p>A shift in the market or from a competitor, and a straight read on whether it matters for you and what to do about it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="close">
  <div class="container">
    <p>Prefer to talk it through? <a href="/contact/">Book a working session &rarr;</a> or see <a href="/resources/">our published work &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}

{% block footer %}
{% include "footer.njk" %}
{% endblock %}
